Test rg66: a size assert that holds as written and fails once the cla goes
// Plain and under -O it assembles; under -O1 or -O2 the region loses a word
// and the second check fails, "after optimization", writing nothing.
100/
go, lac x
%%optimize
    cla
    lac x
%%endoptimize
end, hlt
assert end - go == 3, "three words to end"
x, 0
start go
